<section class="community-page reviews-page">
  <div class="community-hero"><span class="micro">END CULTURE / REVIEWS</span><h1>YOUR WORDS<br>MATTER.</h1><p>Got something to say about END CULTURE? Leave a review below. Submitted reviews are sent to us for approval before they are published.</p></div>
  <div class="review-layout">
    <div class="review-intro"><span>01</span><h2>REAL FEEDBACK.<br>NO NOISE.</h2><p>We want the good, the bad and the useful. Your feedback helps us improve every drop.</p></div>
    <div class="community-form-wrap">
      {% form 'contact' %}
        <input type="hidden" name="contact[subject]" value="END CULTURE — Review Submission">
        <label>YOUR NAME</label><input type="text" name="contact[name]" placeholder="NAME" required>
        <label>EMAIL</label><input type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="EMAIL" required>
        <label>RATING</label><select name="contact[rating]" required><option value="">SELECT</option><option>5 / 5</option><option>4 / 5</option><option>3 / 5</option><option>2 / 5</option><option>1 / 5</option></select>
        <label>YOUR REVIEW</label><textarea name="contact[body]" rows="7" placeholder="TELL US WHAT YOU THINK." required></textarea>
        <button type="submit">SUBMIT REVIEW →</button>
        {% if form.posted_successfully? %}<p class="form-success">REVIEW RECEIVED. THANK YOU.</p>{% endif %}{{ form.errors | default_errors }}
      {% endform %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% schema %}{"name":"Reviews","settings":[]}{% endschema %}